    {
      "v": 4,
      "zh": "她们来到祭司以利亚撒和嫩的儿子约书亚并众首领面前，说：「耶和华曾吩咐摩西在我们弟兄中分给我们产业。」于是约书亚照耶和华所吩咐的，在她们伯叔中，把产业分给她们。",
      "en": "They went before Eleazar the priest, Joshua son of Nun, and the leaders and said, “The Lord told Moses to assign us land among our relatives.”[NOTE:1] So Joshua[NOTE:2] assigned them land among their uncles, as the Lord had commanded.[NOTE:3]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “The Lord commanded Moses to assign to us an inheritance in the midst of our brothers.” Since Zelophehad had no sons, “brothers” must refer to their uncles, as the next sentence makes clear.",
        "Heb “he.” The referent is probably Joshua, although Eleazar is mentioned first in the preceding list.",
        "Heb “and he assigned to them in accordance with the mouth [i.e., command] of the Lord an inheritance in the midst of the brothers of their father.”"
      ],
