    {
      "v": 9,
      "zh": "其界下到加拿河的南边。在玛拿西城邑中的这些城邑都归以法莲。玛拿西的地界是在河北直通到海为止；",
      "en": "The border then descended southward to the Valley of Kanah. Ephraim was assigned cities there among the cities of Manasseh,[NOTE:1] but the border of Manasseh was north of the valley and ended at the sea.",
